{
  "date": "2025-12-26",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모해",
      "en": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는 채연언니랑 있다가",
      "en": "I was hanging out with Chaeyeon-unnie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쫓겨났어",
      "en": "Then I got kicked out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ",
      "en": "ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망키 발로차기 보여줬는데",
      "en": "I showed her Mankey's kicking move."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가래",
      "en": "She told me to go away."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "망키가 그 원숭이 포켓몬이야?",
      "en": "Is Mankey that monkey Pokémon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞아 너무 귀엽게 생겼어",
      "en": "Yeah. It looks so cute."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니가 갑자기 포켓몬 카드를 샀다고해서",
      "en": "Unnie suddenly said she bought Pokémon cards."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "보는데 진짜 웃기게 생김",
      "en": "I looked at them and Mankey looks so funny."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞다 나 자랑하고 싶은거 있어",
      "en": "Oh right, I have something to brag about."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "고세구님이랑 아이네님이랑 같은 화면에 담겼어",
      "en": "I appeared in the same frame as Gosegu-nim and Ine-nim."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감격",
      "en": "I'm so moved."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "꿈이 예지몽이였나",
      "en": "Maybe my dream was a prophetic dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 대박",
      "en": "Seriously amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "성덕이에요",
      "en": "I've become a successful fan."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 진짜 화나는일도 있었어",
      "en": "But something also made me really angry."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 어떤 멤버에게",
      "en": "I told one of the members..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 이세계아이돌분들이랑 챌린지 찍었어!!!! 부럽지 ㅋ케케키키키",
      "en": "\"I filmed a challenge with Isegye Idol!!!! Jealous? ㅋㅋㅋ\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했는데",
      "en": "And then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아~! 알아 그 만화같은",
      "en": "\"Ah~! I know, those cartoon-like ones.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이라고 하는거야",
      "en": "That's what they said."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "만화…?",
      "en": "\"Cartoon...?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "직접 움직이고 말도 하는데… 만화?",
      "en": "They move and talk themselves... cartoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그건 그분들과 나를비롯한 팬분들을 모욕하는말이야.",
      "en": "That's insulting to them and to the fans, including me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라고 함",
      "en": "That's what I told them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "크리스마스 잘 보냈어??",
      "en": "Did you have a good Christmas??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 크리스마스 딱 끝나자 마자",
      "en": "As soon as Christmas ended..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한파시작이래",
      "en": "They said a cold wave started."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 추워",
      "en": "It's so cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 오늘",
      "en": "Today..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "크리스마스 얼론할뻔 했는데",
      "en": "I almost spent Christmas alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "친구 만나서 이 추운 날씨에",
      "en": "But I met up with a friend in this freezing weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요아정가서",
      "en": "We went to Yoajung."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아이스크림 푸파했어",
      "en": "And absolutely devoured ice cream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 푹쉬었어",
      "en": "I had a really good rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "채원이랑 놀고",
      "en": "Hung out with Chaewon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하루종일 자고",
      "en": "Slept all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모범택시 정주행하다가",
      "en": "Binge-watched Taxi Driver."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요아정 먹고",
      "en": "Ate Yoajung."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이게 휴가의 끝임..",
      "en": "And that's how my vacation ended..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "모범택시 재밌음?? 안봤는데",
      "en": "Is Taxi Driver good? I haven't watched it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 유익해지는 드라마야",
      "en": "It's the kind of drama that teaches you things."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "대사도 다",
      "en": "Even the dialogue..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "되게 설명해주듯이",
      "en": "Feels like it's explaining things to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말해서",
      "en": "The way they speak..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "새로운 지식을 쌓는느낌",
      "en": "Makes it feel like you're learning new knowledge."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "6화까지 봤는데",
      "en": "I've watched up to episode 6."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "중고차가",
      "en": "For used cars..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "침수차인지 아닌지는",
      "en": "To tell if it's flood-damaged..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벨트를 끝까지 땡겨보거나",
      "en": "Pull the seatbelt all the way out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "고무 사이",
      "en": "Or check between the rubber seals."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런곳에 진흙이 있는지 없는지",
      "en": "See if there's mud in places like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "보래",
      "en": "That's what they said to check."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 야쿠자의 보스와 친구되려면",
      "en": "And if you want to become friends with a yakuza boss..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "싸움을 걸어라",
      "en": "Start a fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 내용이야",
      "en": "That's the kind of content it has."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "대신 보스보다 싸움 잘해야함",
      "en": "But you have to fight better than the boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나같은 경우엔 흑염룡이 있기 때문에 가능임",
      "en": "For me it's possible because I have the Black Flame Dragon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 채연언니 향수냄새 잔향이 나는데",
      "en": "I can still smell Chaeyeon-unnie's perfume."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 좋네",
      "en": "It smells really nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정보 달라해야지",
      "en": "I should ask what perfume it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니아니",
      "en": "No, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아까 뿌려봤어",
      "en": "I tried spraying it earlier."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오해금지",
      "en": "No misunderstandings."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭘 오해해? 암튼",
      "en": "What are you even misunderstanding? Anyway..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },

    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "피부에 뭐 난거는 이제 괜찮?",
      "en": "Is your skin doing better now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안 괜찮",
      "en": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "왜이러는거야?",
      "en": "Why is this happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 이런적 처음이야",
      "en": "This has never happened to me before."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐가 나는게",
      "en": "Having my skin break out like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "피곤해서그런가?",
      "en": "Maybe because you're tired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하루종일 잤는데?",
      "en": "But I slept all day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그거 걍 기초에서 문제가 잇을 수도 잇음 유수분 밸런스 잘 맞춰서 스킨케어해봐",
      "en": "It might just be your basic skincare. Try balancing your skin's oil and moisture."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오 전문적이다",
      "en": "Wow, you sound like a professional."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "최근에 기초제품 플렉스했는데",
      "en": "I recently splurged on skincare products."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 많이 바르면 안좋아?",
      "en": "Is it bad if I apply too much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "원래 내 피부에 자부심을 가지고",
      "en": "I used to be really confident in my skin."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아무것도 안발랐었는데",
      "en": "So I barely put anything on."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "평생",
      "en": "For my whole life."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "몇개 쓰는데?",
      "en": "How many products are you using?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금",
      "en": "Right now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "버블세럼 바르고",
      "en": "I use a bubble serum."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진정세럼바르고",
      "en": "A calming serum."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "크림 바르고",
      "en": "Cream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진정 앰플같은것도 바르고",
      "en": "A calming ampoule too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미스트까지 뿌림",
      "en": "And I even spray mist."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "진정왤케마니해",
      "en": "Why are you using so many calming products?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진정좀 제발 했으면 해서..",
      "en": "Because I desperately want it to calm down..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "오.…. 근데 전에는 어떻게 발랐는데?",
      "en": "Oh... Then what did you do before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "전에는 그냥 아무크림이나",
      "en": "Before, I just used whatever cream."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "로션아무거나",
      "en": "Any lotion."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "대충 바르고",
      "en": "I'd just slap it on."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "바디로션 바를때도 있었는데",
      "en": "Sometimes I'd even use body lotion."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "얼굴 대충 바르고",
      "en": "On my face too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몸바르고",
      "en": "Then the rest on my body."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "메컵쌤이",
      "en": "My makeup artist told me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "피부 좋을때 관리해라",
      "en": "\"Take care of your skin while it's still good.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했던게 진짜였어",
      "en": "Turns out they were right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 평생 아무렇지 않을줄알고",
      "en": "I thought my skin would always stay fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한귀로 흘렸는데",
      "en": "So I ignored it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 스케줄하면서",
      "en": "But lately, with all my schedules..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "화장 너무 많이 하고있어서",
      "en": "I've been wearing makeup constantly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런가",
      "en": "Maybe that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이제 피부화장 안하고 스케줄 해야하나",
      "en": "Maybe I should stop wearing base makeup for schedules."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아우...",
      "en": "Aww..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "왜…",
      "en": "Why..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나쁘지 않아…",
      "en": "It's not that bad..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "피부 톤 나쁘지 않아",
      "en": "My skin tone isn't bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "화장안해도 귀여워",
      "en": "You're cute even without makeup."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "에헬헤헤헤헤헤헤헤헤",
      "en": "Ehehehehehehehehe~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-02.mp3"
    },

    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "10시간 자다가 방금 깬 얼굴도 귀여워",
      "en": "Even your face after waking up from sleeping 10 hours is cute."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그건 내가 감당 못해",
      "en": "I can't handle that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "봐주기 힘들듯",
      "en": "It'd be hard to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시온언니가",
      "en": "Shion-unnie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "두바이 휘낭시에",
      "en": "Made Dubai financiers."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "직접 만들어서 줬어",
      "en": "She made them herself and gave me some."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아직 안먹어봤어",
      "en": "I haven't eaten them yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "낼 먹을거양",
      "en": "I'll eat them tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "직접 아침에 시장까지가서",
      "en": "She even went to the market herself."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재료사서 만든거래",
      "en": "Bought all the ingredients and made them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "넘 감동",
      "en": "I'm so touched."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "편지까지 쓰고있어",
      "en": "I'm even writing her a letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그녀는 제빵사에요",
      "en": "She's a baker."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이도 제빵 해봤어?",
      "en": "Have you ever tried baking too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "전 호떡믹스는 해봤어요",
      "en": "I've made hotteok mix before."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "물론 다 터졌지만",
      "en": "Of course, they all burst though."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래 난 한식마스터니까",
      "en": "But I'm a Korean food master."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "괜찮아",
      "en": "So it's okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "양식도 잘함",
      "en": "I'm good at Western food too."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "라자냐~?",
      "en": "Lasagna~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래!!!",
      "en": "Exactly!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 루까지 만들었다니까",
      "en": "I'm telling you, I even made the roux."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 요즘 냉장고를 부탁해 보는데",
      "en": "I've been watching Please Take Care of My Refrigerator lately."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나가도 잘할듯",
      "en": "I think I'd do well if I went on the show."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "김풍매직",
      "en": "Kim Poong Magic."
    },
